Error [E0310]: `.name` needs a `User`, but this value is `User?` and might be missing
  --> tests/ui/outcome_none_never_passes_up.jet:21:17
    |
 21 |     Ok(Val(user.name))
    |                 ^^^^
 Why: A missing value never leaves the function by itself; it stays an ordinary value until the code handles it
 Fix: Write `?.name` to keep the result optional, add `?? fallback` for a default, or match `.Val(x)` / `.None`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0310
